{"instruction": "Write q code for evict to calculate aggregate statistics in a kdb+ database", "input": "", "output": "evict:{[reqsize;currenttime]\n\tr:select from \n\t\t(update totalsize:sums size from `lastaccess xasc select lastaccess,id,size from cache)\n\twhere prev[totalsize]<reqsize;\n\tdrop[r`id];\n\ttrackperf[r`id;`evict;currenttime];\n\t}"}
