{"instruction": "Help me write a q function named packagesloaded that load data from files or databases", "input": "", "output": "packagesLoaded:{[package;v;allowReload];\n  / If the the thing attempting to be loaded isn't a pure package, we're not going to try restricing it based on package id\n  if[(\"\" ~ v) and (package like \"*-*\") and package like \"*[.0-9]\";\n    l: {$[1 < count x;(\"-\" sv -1 _ x;-1#x);x]}"}
