{"instruction": "Implement a function qpostback that perform data operations in q/kdb+", "input": "", "output": "qpostback:{[proc;query;params;querytype;result]\n  .dqe.updresultstab[first proc;query;params]'[$[`table=querytype;key result;`];value result];\n  .lg.o[`qpostback;\"Postback successful for \",string first proc];\n  }"}
