{"instruction": "Write a q function named writetolog that save data to disk in a kdb+ database", "input": "", "output": "writetolog:{[t;x]\n   /- if x is not a table, make it a table\n   if[not 98h=type x;x:flip cols[value t]!(),/:x];\n  .u.l enlist (`upd;t;x);\n  .u.j+:1;\n  }"}
