{"instruction": "In q/kdb+, Implement a function end that perform data operations for a trading system for financial data", "input": "", "output": "end:{[d]\n  .lg.o[`end;\"end of day invoked\"];\n  /- publish and clear all the tables \n  .ctp.publishalltables[];\n  /- roll over the log you need a new log for next days data \n  .ctp.refreshtp[d+1];\n  /- push endofday messages to subscribers\n  (neg union[@[value;(`.stpps.allsubhandles;`);()]; @[{union/[(value x)[;;0]]}"}
